    "description": "Bluetooth Auto Connect is a Bluetooth Finder App & Bluetooth Scanner App that makes it a super Bluetooth Controller along with the functionalities of Bluetooth Finder for Android and Bluetooth Keyboard. \r\n\r\n'Find your Bluetooth device' with Auto Connect Bluetooth that is a Bluetooth pairing app like Bluetooth Auto Connect with AirPod Battery, AirPod Tracker & Bluetooth Finder for Android.\r\nConnect Bluetooth Devices with Auto Connect Bluetooth which also lets you 'Find my AirPods' & 'Find your Bluetooth Devices' and all Bluetooth Connections\r\n\r\nBluetooth Auto Connect App features include:\r\n\u2738Bluetooth Finder For Android\r\n\u2738Bluetooth Advance for Bluetooth File Share\r\n\u2738Bluetooth Scanner for Android \r\n\u2738Bluetooth Auto Connect \r\n\u2738Find my AirPods Case for Android \r\n\u2738Find my headphones earbuds\r\n\u2738Find my Bluetooth device\r\n\u2738Find Bluetooth device tracker\r\n\u2738Bluetooth Scanner - Wifi analyzer \r\n\u2738AirPod tracker, AirPod Finder, Headphone Finder\r\n\r\nBluetooth Auto Connect Finder has a Bluetooth Device Finder, Wifi analyzer & an AirPod Finder Android along with a Bluetooth scanner. It also has Wifi password show & free wifi with a Bluetooth Finder. \r\nManage Bluetooth auto connect with our Bluetooth Controller app, a Bluetooth tracker for Bluetooth connections with AirPod battery checker & Auto connect Bluetooth device finder app. \r\n\r\nWhy to use Auto Connect Bluetooth Device Finder App?  \r\n\u2738 Wifi analyzer & internet speed meter, Bluetooth finder, Bluetooth Scanner free app\r\n\u2738List of Paired Devices and Bluetooth Connections\r\n\u2738 Find my Bluetooth device, find my AirPods for Android free including Bluetooth speaker, Bluetooth Mouse with Bluetooth controller and all Bluetooth Connections with Auto Connect Bluetooth app\r\n\u2738 Bluetooth Scanner app for Bluetooth Connections including Smart Watch, AirPod battery, Bluetooth keyboard and Bluetooth mouse \r\n\u2738 Using this Bluetooth manager controller & Bluetooth pairing app, you can easily access Bluetooth devices and Bluetooth Connections like Bluetooth Keyboard and mouse with Bluetooth share app.\r\n\u2738 Wifi analyzer with Auto Connect Bluetooth Finder for Bluetooth Connections to show WiFI router password \r\n\u2738 Auto Bluetooth Connect for Android let you access 'Who is using my Wifi' with device name and show you internet speed test with Bluetooth and Wifi connections\r\n\r\n Additional Features of Bluetooth Auto Connect App \r\n\u2738 Auto Bluetooth Connect, AirPod Battery with AirPod tracker for all Bluetooth devices like Bluetooth Car Connect, Bluetooth keyboard and mouse for Android, and Bluetooth Finder scanner pair. \r\n\u2738 Find my AirPods for Android & Find my Bluetooth Device with AirPod Tracker & Bluetooth tracker for Android  \r\n\u2738 WiFi Analyzer, Bluetooth Finder scanner pair catches all information like MAC, IP, Signal Strength, internet speed test with download & upload speed\r\n\r\nAuto Connect Bluetooth app has a Bluetooth Scanner & Bluetooth Tracker through which wifi users can be detected using WiFi detector. Bluetooth Pair Auto Connect is an all-in-one Bluetooth Pairing app for Android that you can use as Bluetooth Scanner app for Android & Bluetooth app sender and receiver with Bluetooth app.\r\n\r\nBluetooth Auto Connect App Offers a Bunch of features including: \r\n\u2738Bluetooth Car connect \r\n\u2738Bluetooth finder scanner pair\r\n\u2738Bluetooth keyboard and mouse for Android\r\n\u2738Bluetooth scanner for Android\r\n\u2738Bluetooth controller for Android\r\n\u2738Bluetooth pairing app for Android \r\n\u2738Bluetooth auto connect for Android free \r\n\u2738Bluetooth Pair Auto Connect \r\n\u2738Bluetooth car connect music \r\n\u2738Bluetooth app sender and receiver \r\n\u2738Bluetooth file transfer app \r\n\u2738Find my AirPods for Android free\r\n\u2738Bluetooth Device Finder App for Bluetooth Connections\r\n\r\nYour feedback on Bluetooth Auto Connect App will be valued!",
